course: dictionary
lesson: 13204
title: Funded and the money words
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: «Funded» means paid for. When someone funds something, they give the money it needs. Look for the clues around the word: money, paid, council, government.
explain: «The new swimming pool was funded by the town council.» The council paid the money, so funded means paid for with money from the council. Try your meaning in the sentence: "The new swimming pool was paid for by the town council." It still makes sense.
explain: Funded is part of the word family fund, funds and funding. Well-funded means given plenty of money to work well. Underfunded means not given enough money. The prefix under- tells you there is too little, just as in underpaid or undercooked.
fact: Funded is the past form of fund, which means to pay for something with money.
fact: «Funded» means paid for by money from a person, group or government.
fact: «Well-funded» means given enough money to work well.
fact: «Underfunded» means not given enough money, so it may struggle.
fact: Useful phrases: funded by, publicly funded, fully funded.
exercise: «The library is funded by the council.» What does funded mean here? | Closed for repairs | Full of books about money | *Paid for with money | Painted in bright colours
exercise: News report: «The hospital was underfunded, so it did not have enough nurses.» What does underfunded mean? | Built under the ground | Given far too much money | *Not given enough money | Very, very old
exercise: Which word means given enough money to work well? | treacherous | hungry | underfunded | *well-funded
test: «The summer camp is fully funded, so every child can go for free.» What does fully funded mean? | *Paid for completely | Sold to a shop | Only half paid for | Cancelled before it began
test: «Our local park is publicly funded.» What does publicly funded mean? | Painted by local artists | *Paid for with public money, such as from the government | Free to sell to anyone | Paid for by one rich family alone
exam: «The club is underfunded, so it has old kit and no coach.» What does underfunded tell you? | It is a brand-new club | *It does not get enough money | It has a famous coach | It gets far too much money
